      "role": "user",
      "content": "new outlets? i dont think you get it. it's not that i'm bored or stuck. it's that the part of me that *could* care about things is just dead. everything feels so heavy and pointless. it's like i've reached the end of my story and there's just nothing written on the next pages. it's exhausting trying to pretend there's still something worth saving here.",
